    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "PLAN",
      "narration_text": "Next, I'll define memory schemas and policies for when to write, retrieve, revise and forget. Then, on one benchmark, I'll compare each setup against no memory, with the same frozen model and tools. The gain per session is the result.",
